REQUEST TEST: Otoscopy_of_Right_Ear

Patient: {'ENT': 'Otoscopic examination reveals a well-healed tympanic membrane graft with no signs of infection, perforation, or retraction. The ear canal is clear.'}

Doctor: Since the ear itself appears healthy post-surgery, I suspect the pain is referred from the temporomandibular joint given your stress and symptoms with eating. Do you have tenderness when I press on your jaw joint or temple area?
